## 2. Требования (SysML Requirement Diagram)

```mermaid
requirementDiagram
    requirement "REQ-1" {
        id: REQ-1
        text: "Система должна обрабатывать заказ"
    }
    requirement "REQ-1.1" {
        id: REQ-1.1
        text: "Проверять наличие товара (Inventory)"
        risk: medium
    }
    requirement "REQ-1.2" {
        id: REQ-1.2
        text: "Обрабатывать платеж (Payment)"
        risk: high
    }

    element "OrderService" {
        type: Class
    }
    element "PaymentGateway" {
        type: Class
    }

    OrderService -- satisfy --> REQ-1.1
    PaymentGateway -- satisfy --> REQ-1.2

    REQ-1 -- contain --> REQ-1.1
    REQ-1 -- contain --> REQ-1.2
```
